flowchart TD
  P[Authenticated principal + sharing policy] --> N[HMAC namespace resolver]
  N --> PRIV[private namespace]
  N --> TEN[tenant trust-group namespace]
  N --> PUB[administrator-approved public-system namespace]
  PRIV --> M1[namespace-scoped manifests]
  TEN --> M2[namespace-scoped manifests]
  PUB --> M3[namespace-scoped manifests]
  M1 --> O[immutable object store]
  M2 --> O
  M3 --> O
  O --> E[encrypted/deduplicated according to policy]
  U[Unauthorized principal] -. denied before lookup .-> X[No existence disclosure]
